# The §30 semantic snapshot route (audit §30; default-off): the driver
# house of the env-gated artifact gates (shared with the driver-level LIR
# route gates) — the snapshot builder is full-library-only and the
# compiler kernel stays closed. The §39 semantic-server construction
# (audit item 21) rides the
# SAME route: at the successful final compiler boundary the route builds
# the CompilerSession over the finalized state (compiler_session_from_
# finalized — the snapshot route's own env / typed program / verified MIR
# values) and serves the §39 request protocol when TANGERINE_SERVER=1
# requests it (session_serve_loop); the snapshot file is written exactly
# as before when the server env var is unset.
