# fourth-audit P0-2): the snapshot route's SIBLING artifact
# (<snapshot>.lineages) — loaded at build start (empty when absent),
# threaded through the builder's def walk and published after a successful
# build through the ATOMIC temp+rename save so repeated route/server runs
# accumulate lineage history.
